# FF3: a new game from the title into the name screen, then the name changed and confirmed (Testing.md C-51).
#   OpenFF.exe --game=ff3 --drive=Docs/Drives/ff3-name.drive --log=general,file,input --screenshot-dir=shots --screenshot-every=2
# The screen is touch-only, so the taps are in the 800x480 view: the name at ~160,285, Confirm at ~333,428.
# Twelve A presses 2.5 s apart carry the title and the opening to the name screen (~78 s).
wait 6
press Z
wait 2.5
press Z
wait 2.5
press Z
wait 2.5
press Z
wait 2.5
press Z
wait 2.5
press Z
wait 2.5
press Z
wait 2.5
press Z
wait 2.5
press Z
wait 2.5
press Z
wait 2.5
press Z
wait 2.5
press Z
wait 2.5
say at the name screen
wait 2
tap 160 285
wait 1.5
type
type Karl
wait 1
submit
wait 1.5
say typed
tap 333 428
wait 4
say confirmed
wait 6
press Z
wait 3
press Z
wait 3
quit
